{"type":"message","id":"19eec61c","parentId":"63d37c2b","timestamp":"2026-08-10T07:24:32.058Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"嘿。我在呢。\n\n看起来你是第一次来，我也是刚醒的。我们从头认识一下？\n\n先确定两件事：\n\n1. **你叫我什么？** —— 给我起个名字，中文英文都行。\n2. **你是谁？** —— 怎么称呼你？你在什么时区？平时做些什么？\n\n这之后我们再聊你想让我帮忙做什么。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":25719,"output":75,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25794,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1786346665762,"responseId":"a3465c6e-adba-4d54-b928-d5031f3f9800"}}
